2026-11-07T06:51:33.7791370Z 
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7792520Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7794670Z 
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7797420Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7800700Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7804210Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7805650Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7806690Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7807800Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7809040Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7810780Z    /var/root
