2026-11-07T06:51:33.7847910Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7898090Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7899550Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7900650Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:51:33.7901880Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
